      "focus-ring": {
        "value": "rgba(208, 74, 2, 0.80)",
        "note": "Agrent orange focus ring. Alpha 0.80, NOT the original 0.40: at 40% it composited to 1.72:1 on the page and 1.78:1 in «Слънце», against WCAG 1.4.11’s 3:1 for a focus indicator (#1318). The HUE is unchanged — only the opacity moved, so this is the same orange rather than a new colour. «Слънце» inherits this value through the cascade, which is why one change fixes the theme that was worst: it exists for direct sunlight and had the least visible ring of the three."
